# BRIDGENODE portfolio site: response headers (documentation)
#
# This file uses the Netlify / Cloudflare Pages "_headers" format.
# Render static sites do NOT read this file. On Render, set the same headers in
# the dashboard (Settings > Headers) or in render.yaml under `headers:`.
#
# Why: the main BRIDGENODE homepage (bridgenode-studio.calmgrou.chatgpt.site)
# fetches portfolio.json from this site, which is a different domain.
# Without Access-Control-Allow-Origin the browser blocks that fetch (CORS).

/portfolio.json
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
